## 14. Limitations

This walkthrough is explanatory/composite only.

It does not implement production E2E, production Fractal Cell runtime,
production distributed runtime, production DRS, production AVF, production
GT/LGT, production LGT, external/global DRS, autonomous action, connector side
effects, public WOW, whitepaper/public auditor packet, manifest mutation,
transition matrix mutation, direct reuse permission, action permission, or
FinalOutput authority.

Default run does not use network/Gemini/real model calls.

Real Semantic Runtime MVP is not complete.

## 15. Auditor conclusion

PASS.

The walkthrough safely presents the broadest current semantic runtime thread
without creating new authority. It shows that Hedgehog OS can write/resolve
memory, vectorize and rank candidates, apply advisory review, enforce bounded
actor contracts, run bounded child Fractal Cell execution, and return outputs
upward for parent/Post V&V/GT/Root review. It also catalogs historical layers
and optional live LLM/Gemini evidence without making them default PASS
dependencies or authority. Root remains final authority.
